**How the Extension Works**
You will need to initialize a browser extension using the `chrome://extensions` protocol. Add the following to your Chrome setup page:

```html
<script>
  // Clear cache and cookies
  Chrome.crows.chrome.chrome.extensions.removeChild(chrome.extensions.app);
  // Restart the browser
  Chrome.process.restart();
</script>
```

**The Extensions**

**1. Amazon Retailer**
